          "short": "$5.85$",
          "worked": "Using $200=2.00\\times10^2$:\n$$\\begin{align*}\\log_{10}\\sqrt[3]{200}&=\\tfrac13(\\log_{10}2.00+2)\\\\\\log_{10}\\sqrt[3]{200}&\\approx\\tfrac13(0.3010+2)\\\\\\log_{10}\\sqrt[3]{200}&\\approx0.7670\\end{align*}$$\nUsing the table in reverse:\n$$\\sqrt[3]{200}\\approx10^{0.7670}\\approx5.85$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
